Only past events from this request's principal count.

@id("permit_sell_open_session_rate_limited")
PERMIT any OAuthUser to perform SellShares on any resource
  when:
    a Login response with this request's user and output result = true occurred within the last 8 hours
    and no Logout request for that user has occurred since then
  when:
    an ApproveSale response with this request's user and stock and output approved = true occurred within the last 1 hour
  when:
    the number of SellShares requests with this request's user within the last 1 hour <= 3

@id("forbid_insider_notes")
FORBID any principal to perform SellShares on any resource
  when: the flagged field of Text::Scan(the request's notes) is true

@id("forbid_sell_amzn")
FORBID any principal to perform SellShares on any resource
  when: the request's stock == "AMZN"

@id("permit_admin_approve")
PERMIT any IamEntity to perform ApproveSale on any resource
  when:
    a Login response with this request's user occurred within the last 1 hour
    and no SellShares request with this request's user and stock has occurred since then
